  "steps": [
    "Heat a large stock pot over medium-high heat. Crumble in the ground chuck and sausage and cook until evenly browned. Drain off excess grease.",
    "Add the chili beans, spicy chili beans, diced tomatoes, and tomato paste. Add the onion, celery, green and red bell peppers, chile peppers, bacon bits, bouillon, and beer. Season with the chili powder, Worcestershire, garlic, oregano, cumin, hot sauce, basil, salt, pepper, cayenne, paprika, and sugar.",
    "Stir to blend, cover, and simmer over low heat for at least 2 hours, stirring occasionally. Serve over Fritos, topped with Cheddar."
  ]
